= November 2025 — A promise made when everyone polled higher

[? if third_way_split: Poland 2050 is weaker, Third Way is gone and Hołownia's
office is its last major national asset.?][? if third_way_active: Third Way
survived its June deadline, but Hołownia's office remains Poland 2050's largest
asset inside the pact.?] The written coalition agreement gives the chair to
Lewica, and the delegation would send **[+ left_marshal_nominee +]**; enforcing
the claim can still fracture the centre.

[? if left_in_government: Lewica is a party to the governing agreement and can
decide whether to enforce, renegotiate or waive its own coalition claim.?]
[? if not left_in_government: Lewica is outside the cabinet. It can nominate a
Marshal candidate and force a recorded Sejm choice, or waive its claim; it
cannot order governing parties to execute their old coalition agreement.?]

- @marshal_enforce
- @marshal_compensate
- @marshal_delay
- @marshal_alternative
- @marshal_opposition_nominate_czarzasty
- @marshal_opposition_nominate_alternative
- @marshal_opposition_release

@marshal_enforce
title: Put Czarzasty to a vote on the original terms
subtitle: Nominate without paying twice and make Poland 2050 answer in the chamber.
