We table Czarzasty under the agreement already signed and refuse a second
price. Our factions rally around the claim; Poland 2050 prepares to make the
Sejm vote a judgment on whether old promises survive its collapse.

- @marshal_rotation_vote: Count the Marshal vote

@marshal_compensate
