!}

Committee places and policy guarantees give Poland 2050 a reason to honour the
rotation. Czarzasty still needs the chamber; the bargain merely turns former
hostages into MPs the coalition can whip.

- @marshal_rotation_vote: Count the compensated Marshal vote

@marshal_delay
