We defend the delegation's claim without resurrecting a leader already removed.
[? if left_marshal_nominee = "Marta Stożek": Razem controls the party, so the
rotation carries **Marta Stożek** to the chamber rather than the founder of the
apparatus Razem defeated. The old machine calls the chair stolen twice.?][? if
