office candidate; the old machine asks whether the rotation was ever meant for
the party rather than Czarzasty.?]

- @marshal_rotation_vote: Count the alternative nominee's vote

@marshal_rotation_vote
title: The Sejm votes on its Marshal
subtitle: The coalition agreement supplies a nominee, not the office
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
const marshalTotal = Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460);
const marshalLeftBase = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        marshalTotal,
        Math.round(
            Number(Q.left_committed_seats) || Number(Q.left_seats) || 0
        )
    )
);
let marshalNonLeftBase = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.government_support_seats) || 0)
);
if (marshalNonLeftBase <= 0) {
    marshalNonLeftBase = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0) - marshalLeftBase
    );
}
marshalNonLeftBase = Math.min(
    marshalTotal - marshalLeftBase,
    marshalNonLeftBase
);
const marshalGovernmentBase = marshalLeftBase + marshalNonLeftBase;
const marshalWhipStress =
    (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) * 0.35 +
    (Number(Q.p2050_coalition_dissent) || 0) * 0.45 +
    Math.max(0, 50 - (Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0)) * 0.20 -
    (Number(Q.marshal_rotation_whip_bonus) || 0);
const marshalDefections = Math.min(
    marshalNonLeftBase,
    Math.max(0, Math.round((marshalWhipStress - 20) / 5))
);
const marshalOppositionPool = Math.max(
    0,
    marshalTotal - marshalGovernmentBase
);
const marshalOppositionAbsent = Math.min(6, marshalOppositionPool);
const marshalDefectionNo = Math.ceil(marshalDefections * 0.65);
const marshalDefectionAbstain =
    marshalDefections - marshalDefectionNo;
Q.marshal_rotation_left_yes = marshalLeftBase;
Q.marshal_rotation_non_left_base = marshalNonLeftBase;
Q.marshal_rotation_defections = marshalDefections;
Q.marshal_rotation_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    marshalGovernmentBase - marshalDefections
);
Q.marshal_rotation_no = Math.max(
    0,
    marshalOppositionPool - marshalOppositionAbsent + marshalDefectionNo
);
Q.marshal_rotation_abstain = marshalDefectionAbstain;
Q.marshal_rotation_absent = marshalOppositionAbsent;
Q.marshal_rotation_present =
    Q.marshal_rotation_yes + Q.marshal_rotation_no +
        Q.marshal_rotation_abstain;
Q.marshal_rotation_threshold =
    Math.floor(Q.marshal_rotation_present / 2) + 1;
Q.marshal_rotation_vote_passed =
    Q.marshal_rotation_present >= Math.ceil(marshalTotal / 2) &&
    Q.marshal_rotation_yes >= Q.marshal_rotation_threshold ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.marshal_rotation_vote_passed) {
    Q.sejm_speaker = Q.marshal_rotation_nominee;
    Q.sejm_rotation_crisis = 0;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.marshal_rotation_nominee + " wins the recorded Marshal vote";
} else {
    Q.sejm_speaker =
        "Senior Deputy Marshal (acting after inconclusive rotation vote)";
    Q.sejm_rotation_crisis = 1;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 2;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The rotation vote is inconclusive and an acting Marshal remains";
}
!}

= Recorded chamber vote

Nominee: **[+ marshal_rotation_nominee +]**

**Yes [+ marshal_rotation_yes +] · No [+ marshal_rotation_no +] · Abstain [+
marshal_rotation_abstain +] · Absent [+ marshal_rotation_absent +]**

The declared governing base was **[+ marshal_rotation_left_yes +] Lewica + [+
marshal_rotation_non_left_base +] non-Lewica MPs**. Coalition and Poland 2050
dissent removed **[+ marshal_rotation_defections +]** votes after the selected
whip agreement. With **[+ marshal_rotation_present +]** present, the required
majority was **[+ marshal_rotation_threshold +]**.

[? if marshal_rotation_vote_passed: The Sejm—not Lewica's leadership—elects [+
marshal_rotation_nominee +] as Marshal.?][? if not marshal_rotation_vote_passed:
The nomination fails. The acting Marshal keeps the chair while the coalition
decides whether another candidate can command a majority.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Record the vote

