@marriage_implement
title: Issue immediate registry guidance and defend EU rights
subtitle: Give couples usable documents now and take responsibility for a fight with PSL and the Palace.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: minority_safety += 5; progressive_credibility += 4; european_judgment_compliance += 5; psl_relation -= 3; president_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Registries receive a rule before Parliament finds a majority"

National guidance tells registries which foreign marriages to enter and tells
administrators which family rights follow. Couples gain documents they can use
without beginning a new case in every office. PSL and the Palace object to the
scope, but the government owns compliance rather than outsourcing it to litigants.

- @poland_event_queue: File immediate recognition guidance

@marriage_bill
title: Use the ruling to introduce full marriage equality
subtitle: Refuse to make cross-border recognition the final settlement and reopen the domestic equality fight.
on-arrival: progressive_credibility += 7; feminist_trust += 3; psl_relation -= 10; government_coalition_dissent += 8; president_relation -= 5; far_right_agenda += 5; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 14; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 10; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_backlash += 9; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_left_ownership += 10; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 9 if public_climate_progressive_index >= 48; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support -= 8 if public_climate_progressive_index < 48; news_headline = "The European ruling becomes the opening of a domestic marriage fight"

Lewica introduces equal marriage under Polish law instead of treating a
cross-border judgment as the destination. Equality organisations gain the bill
they asked for; PSL and the President prepare to stop it, and the right opens a
sovereignty campaign. Introduction begins the fight—it does not enact the right.

- @poland_event_queue: File the equal-marriage bill

@marriage_registry_truce
title: Implement recognition but declare a cultural truce on wider reform
subtitle: Legal compliance and centrist relations improve; the developmental-right path opens at a cost to progressives.
on-arrival: european_judgment_compliance += 5; minority_safety += 2; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience -= 12; public_mood_pending_abortion_rights_salience -= 4; public_mood_pending_secular_state_salience -= 3; cultural_issue_salience -= 8; economic_issue_salience += 5; left_right_score += 6; left_cultural_position += 4; social_patriot_support += 8; razem_right_score += 8; matysiak_development_pressure += 8; psl_relation += 6; p2050_relation += 5; progressive_credibility -= 6; progressives_dissent += 10; spring_dissent += 6; razem_dissent += 7; news_headline = "Lewica implements the judgment while declaring a truce on cultural legislation"

[? if left_in_government: The government orders registries to comply, then
Lewica declares that equal marriage, abortion and church-state reform will not
reopen this term.?][? if not left_in_government: Lewica helps willing councils
apply the judgment but abandons a national enforcement campaign, then declares
that equal marriage, abortion and church-state reform will not reopen this
term.?] Couples with foreign marriages gain recognition where administrators
comply. Social-patriotic and developmental currents gain the economic turn
they wanted; progressive members hear their party convert a court victory into
the boundary of its ambition.

- @poland_event_queue: Record recognition and the cultural truce

@marriage_delay
title: Await detailed administrative and court guidance
subtitle: Avoid an immediate fight and make married couples carry the uncertainty from office to office.
on-arrival: european_judgment_compliance -= 2; progressive_credibility -= 3; psl_relation += 2; public_trust -= 1; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += -5; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_left_ownership += -4; news_headline = "Uncertainty shifts the cost of delay onto married couples"

[? if left_in_government: The government waits for more instructions and
leaves each registry to decide how much uncertainty it can impose. PSL avoids
an immediate coalition fight.?][? if not left_in_government: Lewica declines
to publish guidance or begin test litigation and waits for the government to
act. PSL avoids an immediate parliamentary fight.?] Married couples continue
carrying lawyers and translated certificates between offices while Poland's
compliance is tested one refusal at a time.

- @poland_event_queue: File the administrative delay

@marriage_opposition_guidance
title: Publish model registry guidance and litigate non-compliance
subtitle: Opposition can support couples and councils, but cannot issue a national administrative instruction. Cost: 1 resource.
view-if: left_in_government = 0
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The legal-support network cannot be financed.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; minority_safety += 3; european_judgment_compliance += 2; local_network += 3; media_capacity += 2; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Lewica gives councils and litigants a model while ministries retain executive authority"

Lewica lawyers publish sample registry forms for willing councils and finance the first
challenges to refusal. Couples gain a usable argument and local officials gain
cover to comply. The ministries still own national administration, so every
success also documents the executive guidance they have failed to issue.

- @poland_event_queue: Send the opposition registry model to the desk
